Frozen benchmark inputs
=======================

suites/*.cases.json contains normalized excerpts from these pinned upstream
datasets. The original question text and reference answers are preserved; row
identifiers, scorer names and provenance metadata are added by this harness.
No model answers or benchmark results are included.

ZebraLogic, WildEval
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/WildEval/ZebraLogic
  Revision: 0a473f5a0054835754ed156d5a79c6ce27178bb1
  Source: grid_mode/test-00000-of-00001.parquet
  Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.01100
  The downloaded dataset card contains citation information but no explicit
  license field. This notice does not assign a new license to those inputs.

BigBench Extra Hard (BBEH), Google DeepMind / Google LLC
  https://github.com/google-deepmind/bbeh
  Revision: 80d12ca916b7158f22293fcf3144f4d3d854d4be
  Source: bbeh/mini/data.json
  Apache License 2.0; license text retained at third_party/bbeh/LICENSE.
  third_party/bbeh/evaluate.py is copied unchanged from bbeh/evaluate.py at
  the same revision, with original copyright and license notices preserved.
  third_party/bbeh/source.json records its original path and file hashes.

Omni-MATH, KbsdJames/Omni-MATH contributors
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/KbsdJames/Omni-MATH
  Revision: 40ba231d8f16e29ecd40e6407e2c8640145a8f62
  Source: test.jsonl
  Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.07985
  The upstream dataset card declares Apache License 2.0; the standard license
  text is retained at third_party/bbeh/LICENSE.

Full upstream datasets, their downloaded documentation and any future MuSR
inputs remain in the ignored data/ cache unless selected into a frozen suite.
sources.lock.json pins the download locations and versions. Per-file upstream
hashes and per-question hashes are retained with the frozen suites.
